# Copy to ".env". A phone running Expo Go can't reach "localhost" and mean
# your dev machine -- that resolves to the phone itself. Use your machine's
# LAN IP instead (phone and computer must be on the same Wi-Fi network).
#
# Find yours with:
#   Windows:      ipconfig            (look for "IPv4 Address")
#   macOS/Linux:  ifconfig | grep inet
#
# EXPO_PUBLIC_* vars are inlined into the JS bundle by Metro at build time --
# same mechanism the web client uses for VITE_API_BASE_URL. There's nothing
# secret in this one (it's just a URL), so that's fine.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.100:3000
